{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","roleHeading":"Article"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/GettingStarted"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"anchor":"Requirements","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Requirements"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 16.0+"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift 5.9+"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode 16+","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.adyen.com\/issuing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" integration on your backend"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Attest"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement ("},{"code":"com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") to your app:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"development\""},{"type":"text","text":" for testing. Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnvironment.test"},{"type":"text","text":". Card operations work fully, but the provisioning flow is limited."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set to "},{"code":"\"production\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for production. Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnvironment.live","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The full provisioning flow requires an App Store or TestFlight build.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TestFlight builds automatically set the App Attest environment to "},{"code":"\"production\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Embed the Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}]},{"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Fetch a Session Token"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the s